{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/7696","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/7696/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/7696/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/7696/events","html_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/7696","id":6271359664,"node_id":"PR_kwDOJWP4788AAAABNqO0UA","number":7696,"title":"mcpx(testsupport): one parser for MCPX_TEST_REQUIRE, and enforce every listed entry (#6904)","user":{"login":"dezren39","id":11225574,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMjI1NTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11225574?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39","html_url":"https://github.com/dezren39","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-11-08T13:22:19Z","updated_at":"2026-11-10T21:23:23Z","closed_at":"2026-11-10T21:22:12Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/pulls/7696","html_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/7696","diff_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/7696.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/7696.patch","merged_at":"2026-11-10T21:22:12Z"},"body":"## What\n\n`MCPX_TEST_REQUIRE` had two parsers in the same package, and CI's `python3` entry was enforced by nothing. Both are fixed here.\n\n- **One parser.** `parseRequireList` in `pkgs/mcpx/internal/testsupport/require.go` is now the only place the variable is parsed. It states the label and wildcard rules once (`realsoftware`/`real`/`*` demand every real server; `*` never names a binary), lower-cases every entry, and `realRequired` in `realserver.go` calls it instead of keeping its own copy. Case is insignificant for runtime binaries and real servers alike — `MCPX_TEST_REQUIRE=RealSoftware` previously demanded a *binary* named `realsoftware` (failing a missing runtime) while demanding no real server at all.\n- **Suite-level enforcement.** `MissingRequiredBinaries()` checks every listed entry against `PATH`, and `TestRequiredBinariesAreOnPath` fails the suite when one is absent. Before this, enforcement was purely per-test, so an entry no test passes to `RequireBinary` — `python3` in `.github/workflows/mcpx.yml:178` — was checked by nothing and a missing `python3` narrowed the run silently. `python3` stays in the workflow list, now with a consumer.\n\n## Tests\n\n- `go test ./internal/testsupport/ -count=1` — pass (unset and with `MCPX_TEST_REQUIRE=deno,bun,node,python3`)\n- `MCPX_TEST_REQUIRE=deno,mcpx-no-such-binary-5584 go test ./internal/testsupport/ -run TestRequiredBinariesAreOnPath` — fails naming the absent binary, as intended\n- New tests pin the case rules (`RealSoftware`/`REALSOFTWARE`/`realsoftware`), that labels and `*` never leak into the binary set, and the suite-level check itself.\n\nCloses #6904\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796736142&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=7696&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F7696&signature=247b3510497cad65d47bd2cdea034f0c11aac26cb25269d70d8496fdf5208438\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/7696?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\">Open in [code]smith</a> · Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->","closed_by":{"login":"dezren39","id":11225574,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMjI1NTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11225574?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39","html_url":"https://github.com/dezren39","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.c